.TH FTRUNCATE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
ftruncate \- change the length of an open file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int ftruncate(int descriptor, off_t length);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets the length of the file identified by descriptor to length bytes.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR truncate (3crunch),
.BR ftruncate (2)
